# dependencies
/node_modules
# The nested one was never ignored — `/node_modules` is root-anchored — so 8282 files of
# functions/ dependencies were tracked, and already stale (jest/ts-jest/@babel were
# declared in functions/package.json and absent from the tree). package-lock.json is the
# source of truth: run `npm --prefix functions ci`.
